        "content": "## Fetch and Process Video Content\n\nThis step fetches YouTube video details and transcript.\nThe transcript is cleaned and sent to OpenAI to generate: LinkedIn Post, Twitter Thread, Blog Content, YouTube Description\nThis prepares all AI-generated content for storage and publishing."
